{
  "headline": "Net Revenue declined by 42.8% (Rs 90.38 lakh) in the focal period.",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "We evaluated the Net Revenue decline of 42.8% (Rs 90.38 lakh) using difference-in-differences estimation and placebo falsification tests.",
      "tier_from": "headline"
    },
    {
      "text": "Localization analysis indicates that Partner channel in Large Appliances accounts for 43.5% of the total revenue drop, supported by a sample size of 130.",
      "tier_from": "localization[0]"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Partner channel in the South region accounts for 30.9% of the total revenue drop, with a support size of 275.",
      "tier_from": "localization[1]"
    },
    {
      "text": "Decomposition of the movement shows volume decline accounted for 96.9% of the overall loss (Rs 36.30 lakh), while price variance contributed 3.4% and mix shift contributed -0.3%.",
      "tier_from": "decomposition[0]"
    },
    {
      "text": "In testing the broader Partner channel movement, the treated group fell 41.4% against a control movement of 0.0% with z = -5.4.",
      "tier_from": "drivers[0]"
    },
    {
      "text": "Placebo timing validation across 10 windows showed a diff-in-diff of 5.5pp against noise standard deviation of 7.7pp, allowing the channel driver hypothesis to survive.",
      "tier_from": "drivers[0]"
    },
    {
      "text": "A narrower hypothesis isolating Partner channel Large Appliances was rejected after a placebo window diff-in-diff of 18.0pp exceeded the noise standard deviation of 6.6pp across 10 windows.",
      "tier_from": "rejected_hypotheses[0]"
    },
    {
      "text": "A rival hypothesis attributing the drop to broader Large Appliances category movement was also rejected, producing an 18.8pp placebo diff-in-diff against 6.4pp noise across 10 windows.",
      "tier_from": "rejected_hypotheses[1]"
    },
    {
      "text": "To address this driver, Finance Operations should deploy the paid_marketing_spend lever to recover the expected gap of Rs 90.38 lakh.",
      "tier_from": "action"
    },
    {
      "text": "Effectiveness must be monitored after 14 days against a target threshold of Net Revenue recovering to within 2% of expected baseline.",
      "tier_from": "action"
    }
  ]
}
